{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50362","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十五、三攒草咏 · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十五、三攒草咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池草三[二七]攒别，能芳二月[春]。\n渌（绿）苔生[二八]水嫩[二九]，翠色出泥新[三○]。\n弄[三一]舞飡花蝶，潜惊触钓鳞。\n芳菲观不厌，留兴待诗人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50362.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50362","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}